  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "呼……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "547C20262026001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊，<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF0C00100002010000003002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎麼了？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E9EBC4E86FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在嘆氣？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572856066C23FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "安馨兒她真的很厲害。\n連烈空坐的事也搞定了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B8999A851525979771F76845F8853B25BB33002000A902370C87A7A575076844E8B4E5F641E5B9A4E863002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "發生什麼事了？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "767C751F4EC09EBC4E8B4E86FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和我說說吧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C62118AAA8AAA54270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1D3002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我之前應該有跟<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳說過，\n和我合租房子的朋友<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n參加事務所的試鏡後合格了這件事吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E4B524D61C98A7267098DDF00100003110000FF01014F6059B38AAA904EFF0C000A548C6211540879DF623F5B507684670B53CB00100001BE00000A53C352A04E8B52D9624076848A6693E15F8C5408683C4E8690194EF64E8B5427FF1F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且我有個不是同一個媽媽生的哥哥，\n也就是所謂的同父異母。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E1462116709500B4E0D662F540C4E00500B5ABD5ABD751F768454E554E5FF0C000A4E5F5C31662F62408B027684540C723675706BCD3002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哥哥？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E554E5FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "他是個什麼樣的人？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED6662F500B4EC09EBC6A2376844EBAFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "他叫提耶魯諾。\n我從來沒見過他，也沒和他說過話……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n他也是個很活躍的舞者。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED653EB63D080369B6F8AFE3002000A62115F9E4F866C92898B904E4ED6FF0C4E5F6C92548C4ED68AAA904E8A712026202600100001BE00000A4ED64E5F662F500B5F886D3B8E8D7684821E80053002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我在想這樣下去好嗎？\n開始有種莫名的壓力。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE56211572860F390196A234E0B53BB597D55CEFF1F000A958B59CB67097A2E83AB540D768458D3529B3002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒問題的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92554F984C76840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "玳蘿做自己就好",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73B3863F505A81EA5DF15C31597D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很高興<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這麼說，\n但<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是厲害的訓練家，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n很自然地會充滿自信的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F889AD8820800100003110000FF01014F6059B390199EBC8AAAFF0C000A4F4600100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F53B25BB376848A137DF45BB6FF0C00100001BE00000A5F8881EA71365730670351456EFF81EA4FE176843002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D4E863002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n雖然很突然，但<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳能跟我來場對戰嗎？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果能打出一場精彩的對戰，\n說不定我也能擁有自信了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A96D671365F887A817136FF0C4F4600100003110000FF01014F6059B380FD8DDF62114F8658345C0D623055CEFF1F00100001BE01000A5982679C80FD625351FA4E0058347CBE5F6976845C0D6230FF0C000A8AAA4E0D5B9A62114E5F80FD64C1670981EA4FE14E863002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我就在練習場等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳囉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362115C3157287DF47FD258347B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B356C93002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意和我對戰嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F548C62115C0D623055CEFF1F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊～好緊張喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF5E597D7DCA5F3555943002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯！請多指教！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF018ACB591A63076559FF01001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寶石海星，\n讓對手見識一下像星星一樣的光輝！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF677F36D77661FFF0C000A8B935C0D624B898B8B584E004E0B50CF661F661F4E006A23768451498F1DFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "玳蘿！\n妳太厲害了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73B3863FFF01000A59B3592A53B25BB34E86FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可爾妮！？\n妳什麼時候來的？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF723E59AEFF01FF1F000A59B34EC09EBC664250194F867684FF1F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳們剛開始對戰的時候吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35011525B958B59CB5C0D62307684664250195427FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過話說回來，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳們倆為什麼在對戰呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904E8A718AAA56DE4F86FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B35011500670BA4EC09EBC57285C0D62305462FF1F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我最近有些壓力……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n所以想說和<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>交手，\n打場精彩對戰的話或許我就能找到自信。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167008FD167094E9B58D3529B2026202600100001BE01000A62404EE560F38AAA548C00100002010000004EA4624BFF0C000A625358347CBE5F695C0D623076848A7162168A3162115C3180FD627E523081EA4FE13002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "玳蘿妳很厲害的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73B3863F59B35F8853B25BB37684FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF1F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "玳蘿妳作為超Z隊的成員，\n拯救了密阿雷的大家呀！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73B3863F59B34F5C70BA8D85005A968A7684621054E1FF0C000A62EF65514E865BC6963F96F7768459275BB65440FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā他她是太強了，\n強到有些離譜而已。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n玳蘿妳真的很厲害喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF01014ED65979662F592A5F374E86FF0C000A5F37523067094E9B96E28B5C800C5DF2300200100001BE00000A73B3863F59B3771F76845F8853B25BB35594FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且妳和寶石海星默契十足的舞蹈，\n是別人學不來的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E1459B3548C5BF677F36D77661F9ED8595153418DB37684821E8E48FF0C000A662F52254EBA5B784E0D4F867684300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可爾妮……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF723E59AE20262026001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我當上繼承者的時候，\n也像玳蘿妳一樣很有壓力。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621175764E0A7E7C627F8005768466425019FF0C000A4E5F50CF73B3863F59B34E006A235F88670958D3529B300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟直到現在，超級進化\n還是有一堆讓人搞不清楚的事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF76F4523073FE5728FF0C8D857D1A90325316000A9084662F67094E0058068B934EBA641E4E0D6E05695A76844E8B300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "於是我作為繼承者，\n有時候會煩惱究竟能傳承什麼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65BC662F62114F5C70BA7E7C627F8005FF0C000A6709664250196703716960F17A767ADF80FD50B3627F4EC09EBC300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，與其煩惱不如做自己能做的事，\n當我這樣想清楚之後，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就變得比較積極一點了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904EFF0C82075176716960F14E0D5982505A81EA5DF180FD505A76844E8BFF0C000A7576621190196A2360F36E05695A4E4B5F8CFF0C00100001BE00000A5C318B8A5F976BD48F037A4D69754E009EDE4E86300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說得也是。\n可爾妮，謝謝妳。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA5F974E5F662F3002000A53EF723E59AEFF0C8B1D8B1D59B33002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還有<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳總是幫我。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
